		["{npc:2123}, the priest trainer in the church, sends you to {npc:2129} in {area:159}. Train {spell:613} (Rank 2) from him now: the wounded guard Beryl sends you to needs it."] = "{npc:2123}, el instructor de sacerdotes de la iglesia, te envía con {npc:2129} en {area:159}. Aprende ahora {spell:613} (rango 2) con él: el guardia herido al que te envía Beryl lo necesita.",
