		["{item:6888}: shopping"] = "{item:6888}: compras",
		["{item:6890} is orange from 50 (yellow at 80, green at 100, grey at 120): about 30 crafts to 80. Cook at any fire: a town hearth or your own {object:29784}. {item:6892} costs 2s 50c at its vendor; the arrow picks the nearest one of your faction. Black bears roam the hills of {zone:1432}."] = "{item:6890} es naranja desde 50 (amarillo a 80, verde a 100, gris a 120): unas 30 fabricaciones hasta 80. Cocina en cualquier fuego: el hogar de un pueblo o tu propia {object:29784}. {item:6892} cuesta 2s 50c en su mercader; la flecha elige el más cercano de tu facción. Los osos negros recorren las colinas de {zone:1432}.",
